          "text": "Patterns I've noticed in people who aren't necessarily unhappy, but aren't going anywhere with their lives:\n\n- Never learn anything new unless they're forced to\n- Don't set goals unless their survival / finances make them insecure\n- Talk about what's happening in the world rather than what they're working on\n- Aren't aware of any of this, and making them aware doesn't hurts more than it helps\n\nHard place to be."
